    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f ADD OUR NEW GAMES TO WISHLIST \u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\udd25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/5f79137c63b40c341d75671aeb6db9d7.avif?t=1752835782\" width=620 height=225 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to relax this evening? Our spicy stories are already waiting for you, go ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf53 5 visual novels for every taste</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 27 full-length voice-over animations and a 100+ unique sexy artworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f Match-3 levels (I know you love it) with endless moves for the most relaxed ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1\ufe0f Dozens of achievements - collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows where your choices will lead you, or which steamy sex scenes await you along your journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/45f1508c77d4e23d5b612493ff94b24b.poster.avif?t=1752835782\" width=615 height=499 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/45f1508c77d4e23d5b612493ff94b24b.webm?t=1752835782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/f92a05b3aeefaf063d4311680cba4c94.avif?t=1752835782\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path of an aspiring actor is anything but easy. Charlie knows this discouraging truth like no one else. He\u2019s only got one chance to show what he's made of and ace the audition. And his two obscenely sexy flatmates, Beatrice and Anabel, are ready to lend a hand, or two, in whipping him into tip-top shape! Whether their venture ends with Charlie\u2019s triumph or an impromptu threesome, you're getting a front row seat to this new action-packed novella, \u201cBehind the Scenes!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/12a7e36b56a3c8a5e489c09ef41b3bef.avif?t=1752835782\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mia's independent life did not work out from the very beginning\u2026 Rent debts, a failed art academy exam, and a frighteningly hazy future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was changed by a call from a bestie with a very tempting offer to start doing 18+ streams online. Seemed like easy money, what could go wrong? But... What if someone else finds out about her part-time job? Someone like a cute boy who lives next door? And who is this mysterious fan who doesn't miss a single Mia's stream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/b9cc2ca326f17c40063cd2584b46b2bd.avif?t=1752835782\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone at the university knows that Yumi is a role model. Rich parents, perfect grades and an impeccable reputation. But who knows what is really hiding under the mask of a diligent student?The new arrival to the faculty, Marco, flunks Yumi on the  exam, and all her usual approaches to changing the professor's mind fail. It seems that Marco's  is going to make a really good girl out of her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/60479826536f6bc5cba999d35d776e92.avif?t=1752835782\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kevin has just returned to his hometown for the holidays. What is waiting for him here? A hot summer, parties with hot chicks... and an unexpected meeting with his best friend's mom?! It seems that she doesn't mind teaching Kevin all the basics of sex and the forbidden dreams of his youth are about to come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/a02d3f3cc5a3d7aa586c9b68011f5f00.avif?t=1752835782\" width=616 height=222 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larry just got promoted at the head office of a famous sex toy company! If only his new boss Ada wasn't such a pain in his ass... The petite &quot;office devil,&quot; as the employees love to call her, seems to get off on ruining, not only Larry's day, but his life as well! Or perhaps her panties are drenched merely at the sight of him for a completely different reason...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642820/extras/efe57747d61d7a268d915452380b6783.avif?t=1752835782\" width=616 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studenthood is a time reserved for adventures, ideally juicy and lewd. It\u2019s hard to keep envy in place when your Bro from the sports team gets two hot chicas for roommates, \u2018cause dormitory situation is ass. Now you are also promised a new roommate, so your spirits are high\u2026 until they collide with a ridiculous problem and shatter into pieces. Yeah, you\u2019ve got a perfect little creature at your place, but you can\u2019t understand: is it a girl or a guy? Also, if the perfect little creature doesn\u2019t favor your actions, they are capable of beating the shit out of you with a heavy smarty book. So, how the hell are you supposed to solve this puzzle and discover what they hide under those tight shorts? \u2026because seems like redhead nerdy dweebs are your unexpected type.</p>",
